  "details": "When inputting a password to login to the SDK on Unity, double clicking in the text box only selects \"words\" and not the entire block of text despite the text being visibly censored.\n\nFor example, typing in \"this is four words\" will display as \"******************\", but double clicking on the beginning of the text will only highlight the associated characters in the word \"this\". Similar behavior exists between words separated by symbols like _ ( ) , but not numbers.\n\nCopy/pasting the selected text does *not* work as expected, but this exploit may still key in what characters are symbols vs alphanumeric.",
